This project is a Firefox port and redesign of Nanobrowser (https://github.com/nanobrowser/nanobrowser),
Copyright Nanobrowser contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Nanobrowser's control layer is built on
chrome.debugger (CDP); this project reimplements perception and interaction on Firefox WebExtension APIs and keeps
several of Nanobrowser's design rules: refs that fail closed, consequential actions gated before dispatch, page content
marked as data, and masked secret fields.
